  "desktop-cpu1": "warm: no frame over 34 ms outside a change window in 3 of 3 runs after the one re-run; cold: 0 of 3 runs over 34 ms (max 16.8, 16.8, 33.4); PASS",
  "desktop-cpu4": "warm: none after the one re-run; cold: 0 of 3 runs over 34 ms outside a change window (max 50, 33.3, 33.3: the 50 ms frame of run 1 is inside the hero's painting change window, 34 ms before the change's start, at scroll 854, the box arrival frames themselves are 33.3); PASS",
